$Button=Leave,Tell,guideHades.overview



[notingame]
We need a timelimit for the King of Hades not to sacrifice the Player.
I guess 10 mins would be enough time to try to break free.  We'll test it
to find out.

Also,maybe it would be better if we used the view spot with this one and have
the king of Hades pick up the priest and put him on the altar.


**++**I have no idea how to make the game end once the player gets to the safehaven.  Maybe sacrifice an extra priest?
